        <mxCell id="mPkX6-zf9ussQiieVkIX-12" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;Aging shift in drug therapy&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- strong response from MONO;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- strong response for LPS and Rux.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CD8T&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- high (oppositie) overlap for both LPS and Rux. considering that LPS has in general more sig TFs, higher overlap is expected. also, LPS induced more decreased TFs, high countering the aging TFs with increased in aging is expected.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Rux. shows full overlap with TFs increase and decrease in aging&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" style="text;html=1;w